# Security-sensitive surfaces. With a single maintainer these resolve to the same
# person as the default owner, so the value today is that a change to any of them is
# flagged as touching a protected surface. Split these onto a dedicated security
# reviewer as soon as there is a second maintainer.
#
# Changes here are the ones an AI agent is most likely to get subtly wrong.
/SECURITY.md            @plurp911
